 | the return-stack pointer in a register on the JIT (`jitrp`: 0, 1; Iterations 465, 494; GCC, 64-bit, JIT with jitx; enabled for seed 71 by the owner, 495): a global register variable across the stencils (r15; rbx under regpin 2, r13 under 3); loop -19% of instructions on a GCC JIT design. |
